## Copy to local.properties (gitignored — never commit that file).
## Android Studio writes sdk.dir. Leave the keys blank unless you issue
## your own free keys. Public GitHub Releases strip these via ARETE_PUBLIC_BUILD=1.
##
## NPS:  https://www.nps.gov/subjects/developer/get-started.htm
## RIDB: https://ridb.recreation.gov/
#
# sdk.dir=/path/to/Android/sdk
# NPS_API_KEY=
# RIDB_API_KEY=
